<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak VSZ plans up to three bln SKK, 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Slovak VSZ plans up to three bln SKK, 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>KOSICE, Slovakia 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>VSZ a.s., Slovakia's largest steel producer, said on Monday it planned to issue a tranche of up to three billion crowns in five-year domestic bonds this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Three billion is the upper ceiling and we hope to conclude the issue by the end of June this year, or very soon after,&quot; VSZ vice-president for finance Jan Seno told Reuters.</p>
</text>
